; Breakage 06b: Duplicate [id] key!
; Crucial friction: OCaml `let` silently shadows duplicate names, so the translator MUST guard uniqueness!

|document[broken-06b]
  :context verisectorium

  |piece[p1].accepted First piece with id p1
    :kind    claim
    :author  "Alice"
    :version 1
    First.

  |piece[p1].draft Second piece colliding on id p1
    :kind    claim
    :author  "Bob"
    :version 1
    Second.
